OL,3,GNEWSA'Major deterrent' needed for small
OL,4,Aboats, says Ed Davey
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of the Liberal Democrats has
OL,7,Fsaid a "major deterrent" is essential
OL,8,Fto end small boat crossings across the
OL,9,FChannel.
OL,11,FIn an interview with BBC South East,
OL,12,FSir Ed Davey said the size of the
OL,13,Fcoastline meant "unless we have a major
OL,14,Fdeterrent like a returns agreement with
OL,15,Fevery single EU country, we won't sort
OL,16,Fit".
OL,18,FHe said the current situation was "not
OL,19,Fgood for the country" or the "people
OL,20,Fwho put their lives in danger" and
OL,21,Freiterated his call for the UK to join
OL,22,Fthe new EU migration pact.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
