OL,3,GNEWSA'Major deterrent' needed for small
OL,4,Aboats, says Ed Davey
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Home Secretary Shabana Mahmood said
OL,7,Fit was a "mistake" to see the EU pact
OL,8,Fas "some sort of silver bullet."
